{"bg_img":"https:\/\/www.sinopeg.com.cn\/uploadfile\/image\/20230320\/20230320161633_97218.png","category_id":"6a15761c36fd3b1e17366834","column_id":"6a154fc77093015d5705df9a","create_time":"2023-03-20 16:13:11","details":"<p>\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#666666;\"><strong>摘要<\/strong><\/span> \r\n<\/p>\r\n<p>\r\n\t<br \/>\r\n<\/p>\r\n<p>\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#666666;line-height:2;\">目前，光热疗法(PTT)和光动力疗法(PDT)的结合已成为治疗肿瘤的有力手段。然而，大多数报道的联合PTT和PDT的例子是在不同波长的激发下使用多组分纳米复合物，导致了复杂的处理过程。本研究通过在2,3-萘菁二氢硅(SiNcOH)表面涂覆DSPE-PEG和DSPE-PEG-NH2，首次成功开发了一种用于光声成像(PA)引导的PTT和PDT肿瘤消融的新型诊断纳米平台(SiNcOH-DSPE-PEG(NH2) NPs)。制备的单剂SiNcOH-DSPE-PEG(NH2) NPs不仅具有良好的水溶性和生物相容性，而且在808 nm近红外激光照射下表现出较高的光热转换效率和单线态氧生成能力。此外，由于其在近红外区域的高吸收，SiNcOH-DSPE-PEG(NH2) NPs也可以作为一种有效的诊断纳米剂用于光声成像。体内外实验结果明确表明，单次近红外激光激发PA成像引导下同时联合PTT和PDT可有效杀灭癌细胞或清除肿瘤组织。SiNcOH-DSPE-PEG(NH2) NPs合成简单、治疗效率高，为实现分子影像引导的联合治疗提供了一种有前景的策略。<\/span> \r\n<\/p>\r\n<p>\r\n\t<br \/>\r\n<\/p>\r\n<p>\r\n\t<br \/>\r\n<\/p>\r\n<p>\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#337FE5;\">Chinese Chemical Letters. Volume 28, Issue 6, June 2017, Pages 1290-1299<\/span><br \/>\r\n<span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#337FE5;\">https:\/\/doi.org\/10.1016\/j.cclet.2017.01.007<\/span><br \/>\r\n<span style=\"font-size:18px;line-height:1.5;color:#666666;\"><strong>Polyethylene glycol phospholipids encapsulated silicon 2,3-naphthalocyanine dihydroxide nanoparticles (SiNcOH-DSPE-PEG(NH2) NPs) for single NIR laser induced cancer combination therapy<\/strong><\/span><br \/>\r\n<span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#337FE5;\">Jing-Ping Wei, Xiao-Lan Chen, Xiao-Yong Wang, Jing-Chao Li, Sai-Ge Shi, Gang Liu, Nan-Feng Zheng<\/span> \r\n<\/p>\r\n<p>\r\n\t<br \/>\r\n<\/p>\r\n<p>\r\n\t<br \/>\r\n<\/p>\r\n<p font-size:14px;background-color:#ffffff;\"=\"\" microsoft=\"\" yahei\",=\"\" \"microsoft=\"\" yahei-regular\";=\"\" font-size:=\"\" 14px;=\"\" white-space:=\"\" normal;=\"\" background-color:=\"\" rgb(255,=\"\" 255,=\"\" 255);\"=\"\" style=\"box-sizing: border-b